{"4311790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pool", "steam_appid": 4311790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Pool</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/f1db01c9e9e4630f77ff76ea18f1e607.avif?t=1787128880\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Line up the perfect shot, feel the smooth control, and enjoy the satisfying click of every ball sinking. Play at your own pace, challenge a friend, and lose yourself in a relaxing, skillful game of pool. 🎱</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/fd52ab96972cba2073e6f04e5fe141c9.poster.avif?t=1787128880\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/fd52ab96972cba2073e6f04e5fe141c9.webm?t=1787128880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/fd52ab96972cba2073e6f04e5fe141c9.mp4?t=1787128880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Pool</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up to the table and enjoy a smooth, satisfying game of pool where every shot feels precise and rewarding. Take your time to line up the perfect angle, watch the balls roll, and enjoy the relaxing rhythm of a classic arcade-style experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/9ddb33d612b8e9082c32c5eab3318680.poster.avif?t=1787128880\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/9ddb33d612b8e9082c32c5eab3318680.webm?t=1787128880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/9ddb33d612b8e9082c32c5eab3318680.mp4?t=1787128880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a singleplayer mode against the CPU and a local multiplayer PvP mode to challenge friends. You can also play in windowed mode, making it easy to enjoy a quick match while multitasking.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Line up the perfect shot, feel the smooth control, and enjoy the satisfying click of every ball sinking. Play at your own pace, challenge a friend, and lose yourself in a relaxing, skillful game of pool. 🎱</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/fd52ab96972cba2073e6f04e5fe141c9.poster.avif?t=1787128880\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/fd52ab96972cba2073e6f04e5fe141c9.webm?t=1787128880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4311790/extras/fd52ab96972cba2073e6f04e5fe141c9.mp4?t=1787128880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Pool</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up to the table and enjoy a smooth, satisfying game of pool where every shot feels precise and rewarding. Take your time to line up the perfect angle, watch the balls roll, and enjoy the relaxing rhythm of a classic arcade-style experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i